
* =====================================================
* EXPERIMENT 2D - COMPLETE 6T SRAM HOLD VERIFICATION
* Supply voltage: 1.8V
* Generic Level-1 MOSFET models
* =====================================================

* Power supply
VDD VDD 0 1.8

* Hold-mode signals
VWL WL 0 0
VBL BL 0 1.8
VBLB BLB 0 1.8

* Inverter 1: output Q
M1 Q QB 0 0 NM W=2u L=0.18u
M2 Q QB VDD VDD PM W=1u L=0.18u

* Inverter 2: output QB
M3 QB Q 0 0 NM W=2u L=0.18u
M4 QB Q VDD VDD PM W=1u L=0.18u

* Access transistors
M5 Q WL BL 0 NM W=2u L=0.18u
M6 QB WL BLB 0 NM W=2u L=0.18u

* MOSFET models
.model NM NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=200u LAMBDA=0.02)
.model PM PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.02)

* Initial stored state
.ic V(Q)=1.8 V(QB)=0

* Transient analysis
.tran 0 20n 0 10p

.save V(Q) V(QB) V(WL) V(BL) V(BLB)

.end
